# Boot-path symbols for the core and rt flavours. These must be =y because
# EVE has no initramfs. This is core's own storage set, deliberately smaller
# than hwe's boot.fragment: core targets eve-kvm on known hardware under a
# hard 290 MiB rootfs cap, so importing hwe's server-HBA list would add
# coverage core has no use for.

BLK_DEV_NVME
SATA_AHCI
BLK_DEV_SD
SCSI_MPT3SAS
SCSI_SMARTPQI
SCSI_HPSA
MEGARAID_SAS
VIRTIO_BLK
BLK_DEV_DM
EXT4_FS
SQUASHFS
VFAT_FS
